Chapter: BvtPitchfork
  cites Uoaix chapter BritainCatalog
  cites Uoaix chapter BritainProduction
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeGatherer
  cites Uoaix chapter GameHarvestState
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck
  cites Foreword chapter Result

 UOAIX-120: wheat (resource row 12) and flax (row 10) are reaped with the pitchfork (item 120, art 0x0E87); cotton (row 9)
 stays picked by hand.
  bvpf-tool : EgCatalog, Integer -> Integer
  bvpf-tool (c) (row) = (list-at c.resources row).tool
  bvt-pitchfork : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-pitchfork (unused) = act
    c <- bb-catalog 0
    a <- bvt-check "the pitchfork is item 120, a Tinkering recipe, and wheat and flax need it; the farmer and flax picker carry it" ((list-at c.items 119).name == "pitchfork" & bb-recipe c 120 0 > 0 & eg-validate c == 0 & bvpf-tool c 12 == 120 & bvpf-tool c 10 == 120 & (cgg-trade-of cgg-farm-place).tool == 120 & (cgg-trade-of cgg-flax-place).tool == 120 & gh-tool-type 120 == 13 & gh-tool-graphic 120 #0E87)
    b <- bvt-check "cotton is still picked by hand, and a pickaxe's art is no pitchfork" (bvpf-tool c 9 == 0 & (cgg-trade-of cgg-cotton-place).tool == 0 & not (gh-tool-graphic 120 #0E86))
    a + b
  end
